<title>FRANCE: Total confirms plans share buy-back.</title>
<headline>Total confirms plans share buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total SA confirmed it would aks a shareholders meeting for authorisation to buy back its own shares, which would boost earnings per share.</p>
<p>A Total spokeswoman confirmed the board of Total will seek authorisation to &quot;reduce and cancel a maximum of 15 million shares&quot; to help even out share price.</p>
<p>The authorisation will be valid for 18 months, she specified.</p>
<p>Total will hold its annual shareholders meeting on May 21.</p>
</text>
